# Range-separated hybrid in the complex basis, unrestricted triplet; the
# energy equals erkale's. (Tighter thresholds hit the numerical noise
# floor of the orbital gradient, about 1e-8.)
System O2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_cam_b3lyp
Multiplicity 3
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-7
SaveChk complex_orbs_o2_camb3lyp.chk
